  "goodToKnow": "Die Neuwahl, usually plural Neuwahlen, is a new or early election: Neuwahlen fordern, vorgezogene Neuwahlen. The Bundestag can't simply dissolve itself; the chancellor must lose a Vertrauensfrage (confidence vote), after which the Bundespräsident may dissolve parliament. This happened in 1972, 1982, 2005 and in December 2024, after the traffic-light coalition collapsed, leading to the February 2025 election. In clubs, eine Neuwahl des Vorstands is a new board election."
